## 📌 SOFTWARE ENGINEERING REQUIREMENT — WEEK 3

### UML Class Diagram — Input Processing

The diagram shows the input data and the processors that prepare it for the animation pipeline.

```mermaid
classDiagram
    class SourceImage {
        +image_data
        +color_mode
        +width
        +height
    }

    class DrivingVideo {
        +video_file
        +fps
        +frames
    }

    class ImageProcessor {
        +convertRGB()
        +cropSquare()
        +resize256()
    }

    class VideoProcessor {
        +extractFrames()
        +getFPS()
        +resizeFrames()
    }

    class AnimationPipeline {
        +processInputs()
    }

    SourceImage --> ImageProcessor
    DrivingVideo --> VideoProcessor
    ImageProcessor --> AnimationPipeline
    VideoProcessor --> AnimationPipeline
```